av:TimeSelectorShape a sh:NodeShape ; rdfs:comment "Structural subset only. An instant or half-open interval in one named media timeline, in exact rational seconds. Also describes the full finite extent of an offered Clip."@en ; sh:closed "true"^^xsd:boolean ; sh:ignoredProperties _:b0299 ; sh:nodeKind sh:BlankNodeOrIRI ; sh:property _:b0300, _:b0612, _:b0649, _:b0686, _:b0773 ; sh:targetClass av:TimeSelector ; sh:xone _:b0140 .
av:TimestampMappingShape a sh:NodeShape ; rdfs:comment "Structural subset only. A declared mapping capability or actual qualified clock mapping, with time basis, seconds-per-tick and a pinned bounded affine-record profile. It is not itself measured exposure evidence."@en ; sh:and _:b0340 ; sh:nodeKind sh:BlankNodeOrIRI ; sh:property _:b0238, _:b0570, _:b0658, _:b0662, _:b0733, _:b0741 ; sh:targetClass av:TimestampMapping .
av:TimestampShape a sh:NodeShape ; rdfs:comment "Structural subset only. An observed instant in rational seconds from one incarnation-specific clock origin, with basis, provenance and optional known uncertainty."@en ; sh:nodeKind sh:BlankNodeOrIRI ; sh:property _:b0370, _:b0434, _:b0753, _:b0755, _:b0771 ; sh:targetClass av:Timestamp .
av:TimingConstraintShape a sh:NodeShape ; rdfs:comment "Structural subset only. A maximum age or pairwise skew in milliseconds for a stated time basis. An age also states the evaluation stage."@en ; sh:closed "true"^^xsd:boolean ; sh:ignoredProperties _:b0437 ; sh:nodeKind sh:BlankNodeOrIRI ; sh:property _:b0729, _:b0758, _:b0770 ; sh:targetClass av:TimingConstraint .
av:TrackRequirementShape a sh:NodeShape ; rdfs:comment "Structural subset only. One logical required or optional track at the wire or delivered boundary. Equal dcterms:identifier values join its wire and delivered contracts within an alternative."@en ; sh:nodeKind sh:IRI ; sh:property _:b0526, _:b0618, _:b0692, _:b0699, _:b0776 ; sh:targetClass av:TrackRequirement .
av:TrackSelectionShape a sh:NodeShape ; rdfs:comment "Structural subset only. A mapping of one offered Track to the wire and/or delivered TrackRequirements of one logical track; the qualified adapter configuration supplies the actual boundary signatures."@en ; sh:nodeKind sh:IRI ; sh:property _:b0228, _:b0495 ; sh:targetClass av:TrackSelection .
av:TrackShape a sh:NodeShape ; rdfs:comment "Structural subset only. One named simultaneous media component of a Mode, with one encoded or raw wire representation. Identity is not an SSRC or device index."@en ; sh:and _:b0751 ; sh:nodeKind sh:IRI ; sh:property _:b0573, _:b0633, _:b0637, _:b0652, _:b0669, _:b0676, _:b0678, _:b0702, _:b0720, _:b0727, _:b0738, _:b0756, _:b0766, _:b0777, _:b0779 ; sh:targetClass av:Track ; sh:xone _:b0134 .
